  "ingredients": [
    "1 (16 ounce) package dry fettuccine noodles",
    "1.5 tablespoons butter or margarine",
    "1 cup chopped green onions",
    "4 cloves garlic, minced",
    "1 pound medium shrimp - peeled and deveined",
    "1 pound sea scallops",
    "2 cups half-and-half cream",
    "salt and pepper to taste",
    "1 cup freshly grated Parmesan cheese",
    "2 tablespoons cornstarch"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/uBkxkBWkWodTiQMVuiZ3-vGVvgM=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/54135-seafood-fettuccine-step-01-9afda981e6604ff48dec4ff521496fc2.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/54135/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Fill a large pot with lightly salted water and bring to a rolling boil. Cook fettuccine at a boil until tender yet firm to the bite, about 8 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/gQ6TjNS8VEaBwPdygeGVAKn4OYU=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/54135-seafood-fettuccine-step-02-f8f016a6aa514a648e0385452f625bb9.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/54135/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Meanwhile, melt butter in a large nonstick skillet over medium-high heat. Stir in green onions and garlic; cook for 1 minute. Stir in shrimp and scallops; cook for 3 minutes, then reduce the heat to medium-low.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/j62FylIv1-iLiYtclogP03CJJ6Y=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/54135-seafood-fettuccine-step-04-cc45607a608548c8966c46c6e390687e.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/54135/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Pour in half-and-half and season with salt and pepper; stir constantly and bring to a simmer, making sure it does not boil. Gradually stir in 1/2 cup Parmesan; cook and stir for 1 more minute, then remove from the heat.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/pGNbJBmNczSgq3i3HYzJqwYWdmA=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/54135-seafood-fettuccine-step-06-7dfa968c458d431694b6bf86c3ee98d0.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/54135/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Drain pasta. Add to the skillet and toss with sauce until thoroughly coated. Sprinkle remaining Parmesan over top and serve immediately.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/3IBAXAM5oL4d5H4SkMfJFgAwtrg=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/54135-seafood-fettuccine-step-07-f910ab1e5e8d4a55b6ca8cf87a1f8761.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/54135/step_05.webp"
    }
  ],
